    "title": "<p>Hereditary tumour syndromes associated with follicular adenoma (FA)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Raja Seethala",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Syndrome</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Gene</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 230.1pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"307\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Thyroid findings</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Carney complex</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>PRKAR1A</em> (17q24.2)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 230.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"307\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Multinodular goitre, FA, differentiated thyroid carcinomas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: black;\">PTEN</span></em><span style=\"color: black;\"> hamartoma&nbsp;</span>tumour&nbsp;syndromes (including Cowden syndrome, Bannayan&ndash;Riley&ndash;Ruvalcaba syndrome)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em><span style=\"color: black;\">PTEN</span></em><span style=\"color: black;\"> (10q23.31)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 230.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"307\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Multinodular goitre, FA, differentiated thyroid carcinomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>DICER1</em> syndrome</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>DICER1</em> (14q32.13)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 230.1pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"307\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Multinodular goitre, FA, differentiated thyroid carcinomas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
